    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Berlin-based still-life/product photographer turned CGI creative director (Communication Design, FH Potsdam 2014). Co-founder, managing director and creative director of PALAM (palam.digital), a hybrid 3D/CGI and art-direction studio he started in 2023 with Vitaly Kiaiev; also works independently as a photographer. Work spans product/fashion CGI and 3D moving image for brands incl. Nike, Adidas, On Running, Rimowa, Bulgari, Byredo, Prada, Jacquemus, Tom Ford. Senior, ~10 yrs; Creative-Director level running his own studio, so fully autonomous (5). Work Status Studio: his own site and LinkedIn agree he founded and leads PALAM. Tagged for his core crafts (photography, 3D/CGI motion, creative direction); the entry leads with him personally, Palam is the studio he runs.",
